<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" pages="13">
  <diagram name="Explain it to a friend" id="uoB31mN68LddsNzcOUFR">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1474" dy="1003" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1900" pageHeight="1200" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="n1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:24px&quot;&gt;Explain it to a friend (5 minutes)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Read the boxes top to bottom. Each one is one or two sentences you can say out loud.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="1700" x="40" y="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C7A76;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;1. What is PsaOnline?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;An online shop for cute accessories in Phnom Penh. &lt;b&gt;Customers&lt;/b&gt; shop on the website; &lt;b&gt;staff and admins&lt;/b&gt; run the shop from the staff portal. The database has &lt;b&gt;28 tables&lt;/b&gt; in &lt;b&gt;7 modules&lt;/b&gt;." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="85" width="820" x="40" y="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n3" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C7A76;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;2. Three words to know&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;PK&lt;/b&gt; (primary key) = the ID of a row, like a student ID. &lt;b&gt;FK&lt;/b&gt; (foreign key) = a column that points to another table’s ID. &lt;b&gt;1 : N&lt;/b&gt; = one row on one side, many on the other (one customer → many orders)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="85" width="840" x="880" y="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n4" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C7A76;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;3. The story of one order (follow it on the PsaOnline ERD page)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;① Dara signs up → a row in &lt;b&gt;users&lt;/b&gt; (her login) and &lt;b&gt;customers&lt;/b&gt; (her shopper profile). ② She picks a product from &lt;b&gt;products&lt;/b&gt; (sorted into &lt;b&gt;categories&lt;/b&gt;). ③ At checkout an &lt;b&gt;orders&lt;/b&gt; row is made, pointing at her &lt;b&gt;customer_addresses&lt;/b&gt; row, with one &lt;b&gt;order_items&lt;/b&gt; row per product. ④ She pays by KHQR → a &lt;b&gt;payments&lt;/b&gt; row (with her slip). ⑤ Staff approve and deliver → each step is a row in &lt;b&gt;order_status_history&lt;/b&gt;. ⑥ The stock goes down with a &lt;b&gt;stock_movements&lt;/b&gt; row. ⑦ Once she has spent $100 she is Pro (6% off), at $500 Max (17% off) — worked out from her orders with &lt;b&gt;loyalty_tiers&lt;/b&gt;. A promo code she typed is the order’s &lt;b&gt;promo_codes&lt;/b&gt; link. ⑧ She reviews it → &lt;b&gt;product_reviews&lt;/b&gt;." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="95" width="1680" x="40" y="215" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n5" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;4. User module&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Who can log in and what they may do. &lt;b&gt;roles&lt;/b&gt; (admin, staff, buyer and roles admins create) have many &lt;b&gt;permissions&lt;/b&gt; through &lt;b&gt;role_permissions&lt;/b&gt; (many-to-many)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="410" x="40" y="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n6" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;5. Customer module&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A &lt;b&gt;customer&lt;/b&gt; IS a user who shops (1 : 1). They have saved &lt;b&gt;addresses&lt;/b&gt;; their tier (Plus / Pro / Max) comes from their spending and &lt;b&gt;loyalty_tiers&lt;/b&gt;. &lt;b&gt;promo_codes&lt;/b&gt; are codes they type at checkout." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="410" x="465" y="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n7" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;6. Product module&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;products&lt;/b&gt; belong to a &lt;b&gt;category&lt;/b&gt; (categories can have sub-categories). Each product has details, pictures, specifications and reviews." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="410" x="890" y="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n8" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;7. Stock module&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;What we buy: &lt;b&gt;suppliers&lt;/b&gt; → &lt;b&gt;purchase_orders&lt;/b&gt; → items. Every stock change is one &lt;b&gt;stock_movements&lt;/b&gt; row; stock = their sum." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="410" x="1315" y="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n9" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;8. Order module&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;An &lt;b&gt;order&lt;/b&gt; has many &lt;b&gt;order_items&lt;/b&gt; (products ⟷ orders is many-to-many), many &lt;b&gt;payments&lt;/b&gt; (a rejected slip, then a new one) and a status history." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="410" x="40" y="455" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n10" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;9. Message module&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Each order has a chat (&lt;b&gt;order_messages&lt;/b&gt;). The bell has no table: it is built from orders, status changes and messages." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="410" x="465" y="455" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n11" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;10. Shop content module&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Things staff change without coding: the home showcase (&lt;b&gt;products.showcase_position&lt;/b&gt;), the shop’s &lt;b&gt;Sort By&lt;/b&gt; menu (with free-delivery groups) and &lt;b&gt;site_settings&lt;/b&gt; (headline, social media)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="410" x="890" y="455" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n12" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#E1F3E9;strokeColor=#1E7A4C;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;11. “Why is there no total column on orders?” (normalization)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Because it can be &lt;b&gt;calculated&lt;/b&gt; from the items. If we stored it too, the two could disagree. That is &lt;b&gt;redundancy&lt;/b&gt;, and removing it is called &lt;b&gt;normalization&lt;/b&gt; (1NF → 2NF → 3NF). Same for the customer’s tier (= from their delivered orders) and stock (= sum of the stock movements)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="820" x="40" y="590" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n13" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#E3EEFA;strokeColor=#2563A8;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;12. “But the item price is stored twice?”&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;No: &lt;b&gt;products.price_usd&lt;/b&gt; is today’s price; &lt;b&gt;order_items.unit_price_usd&lt;/b&gt; is the price agreed in that sale. Prices change, old sales must not, so it is a different fact. Same for the delivery fee and member discount on the order (the blue rows)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="840" x="880" y="590" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n14" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C7A76;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;13. If someone asks “how many relationship types?”&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;One-to-many&lt;/b&gt; (most lines) · &lt;b&gt;one-to-one&lt;/b&gt;: users–customers, products–product_details · &lt;b&gt;many-to-many&lt;/b&gt;: roles⟷permissions, orders⟷products, purchase_orders⟷products, sort_options⟷products · &lt;b&gt;self&lt;/b&gt;: a category inside a category." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="1680" x="40" y="720" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram name="Normalization (1NF to 3NF)" id="Hie2UYTVFpD-rY6A7znX">
    <mxGraphModel grid="1" page="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1900" pageHeight="1200" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="n283" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:24px&quot;&gt;Normalization: removing redundancy (1NF → 2NF → 3NF)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Redundancy = the same fact stored in more than one place. The copies can disagree, so each fact must live in exactly one table; other tables point to it with a foreign key.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="1700" x="40" y="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n284" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C7A76;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Why redundancy is a problem (update anomaly)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Before: &lt;i&gt;orders.total_usd&lt;/i&gt; = $27 is stored, and the same total is also the SUM of its &lt;i&gt;order_items&lt;/i&gt;. If an item changes but the total is not updated (a bug, a crash, a manual edit), the two disagree — which one is true?&lt;br&gt;After: only the items are stored. The total is &lt;b&gt;calculated&lt;/b&gt; when needed, so it can never be wrong." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="820" x="40" y="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n285" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C7A76;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;The three rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;1NF&lt;/b&gt; — one value per cell: no lists, no “several things in one column”.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2NF&lt;/b&gt; — every column depends on the &lt;b&gt;whole&lt;/b&gt; key (matters for tables whose key is two columns).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3NF&lt;/b&gt; — no column depends on another non-key column: &lt;b&gt;nothing that can be calculated or looked up&lt;/b&gt; is stored.&lt;br&gt;Rule of thumb: &lt;i&gt;“the key, the whole key, and nothing but the key.”&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="840" x="880" y="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n286" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#E1F3E9;strokeColor=#1E7A4C;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;1NF fix&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;product_details.specifications&lt;/b&gt; held a list in one cell (Material: …, Size: …, Pack: …), and &lt;b&gt;material&lt;/b&gt;, &lt;b&gt;color&lt;/b&gt; repeated two of those facts in their own columns.&lt;br&gt;→ new table &lt;b&gt;product_specifications&lt;/b&gt;: one row per fact (product_id, name, value). material and color become rows, so they are stored once.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Already 1NF earlier: gallery → product_images; location → latitude + longitude." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="175" width="560" x="40" y="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n287" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#E1F3E9;strokeColor=#1E7A4C;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;2NF fix&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;order_items&lt;/b&gt; (key: order + product) stored &lt;b&gt;product_title&lt;/b&gt; and &lt;b&gt;product_image&lt;/b&gt;. They depend on the product only, not on the order → partial dependency.&lt;br&gt;→ removed. The name and photo come from &lt;i&gt;products&lt;/i&gt; through product_id. Products are never deleted (status = archived), so old orders always find them.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Also: &lt;b&gt;UNIQUE (order_id, product_id)&lt;/b&gt; so one product appears once per order (quantity says how many)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="175" width="520" x="620" y="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n288" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#E1F3E9;strokeColor=#1E7A4C;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;3NF fixes: calculated values removed&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• customers.&lt;b&gt;loyalty_tier_id&lt;/b&gt; = the tier their delivered orders reach (Plus / Pro / Max)&lt;br&gt;• customers.&lt;b&gt;total_spent_usd&lt;/b&gt; = SUM of delivered order totals&lt;br&gt;• orders.&lt;b&gt;discount_usd&lt;/b&gt; = the promo code’s discount on the items&lt;br&gt;• product_stocks.&lt;b&gt;quantity_on_hand&lt;/b&gt; = SUM(stock_movements.quantity_change)&lt;br&gt;• product_stocks.&lt;b&gt;average_cost_usd&lt;/b&gt; = from purchase_order_items&lt;br&gt;• orders.&lt;b&gt;subtotal_usd&lt;/b&gt; / &lt;b&gt;total_usd&lt;/b&gt; = from order_items + fees&lt;br&gt;• purchase_orders.&lt;b&gt;total_cost_usd&lt;/b&gt; = from purchase_order_items" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="175" width="560" x="1160" y="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n289" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#E1F3E9;strokeColor=#1E7A4C;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;3NF fixes: facts stored twice removed&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• orders.&lt;b&gt;order_status_id&lt;/b&gt; — the current status is the newest row of order_status_history&lt;br&gt;• orders.&lt;b&gt;payment_method_id&lt;/b&gt; — the method is on each payments row&lt;br&gt;• orders.&lt;b&gt;handled_by&lt;/b&gt; — who approved it is order_status_history.changed_by&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;user_notifications&lt;/b&gt; (whole table) — the bell is built from orders, status history, payments and messages&lt;br&gt;• orders.&lt;b&gt;customer_name, customer_phone, delivery_address, latitude, longitude&lt;/b&gt; — they are the address the order points to (address_id)&lt;br&gt;• stock_movements.&lt;b&gt;unit_cost_usd, unit_price_usd&lt;/b&gt; — already on purchase_order_items / order_items&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;user_settings&lt;/b&gt; (whole table) — theme, language and notifications stay in the browser, so the database doesn’t need them" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="170" width="860" x="40" y="435" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n290" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#E3EEFA;strokeColor=#2563A8;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Stored on purpose (blue rows) — facts of that moment, not copies&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• order_items.&lt;b&gt;unit_price_usd&lt;/b&gt;: the price agreed in that sale. products.price_usd is today’s price and will change; the old sale must not.&lt;br&gt;• order_items.&lt;b&gt;unit_cost_usd&lt;/b&gt;, purchase_order_items.&lt;b&gt;unit_cost_usd&lt;/b&gt;: what the item cost at that time (for profit).&lt;br&gt;• orders.&lt;b&gt;delivery_fee_usd, member_discount_usd&lt;/b&gt;: the rules (free delivery, the customer’s tier that day) change over time.&lt;br&gt;• payments.&lt;b&gt;amount_usd&lt;/b&gt;: what was actually paid in that attempt.&lt;br&gt;These cannot be calculated later, so storing them is &lt;b&gt;not&lt;/b&gt; redundancy." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="170" width="800" x="920" y="435" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n291" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C7A76;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Tables changed&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;product_stocks removed&lt;/b&gt;: after taking out the calculated columns only low_stock_threshold was left, so it moves to &lt;i&gt;products&lt;/i&gt; (one table less).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;product_specifications added&lt;/b&gt; (1NF).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;showcase_products removed&lt;/b&gt;: a product’s place in the showcase is one column, products.showcase_position.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;loyalty_transactions removed&lt;/b&gt;: points could not be spent; membership comes from spending.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;promo_codes added&lt;/b&gt;; orders point at the code they used.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;customer_addresses.archived_at&lt;/b&gt;: an address used by an order is never edited, so every order keeps the address it was really sent to.&lt;br&gt;• loyalty_tiers is a lookup table (spend ≥ min_spend_usd), no foreign key." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="860" x="40" y="625" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n292" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#E1F3E9;strokeColor=#1E7A4C;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Result&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;28 tables&lt;/b&gt; (−product_stocks, −user_settings, −user_notifications, −showcase_products, −loyalty_transactions, +product_specifications, +promo_codes).&lt;br&gt;Every removed column was either calculated or a second copy of a fact.&lt;br&gt;Every table is in &lt;b&gt;3NF&lt;/b&gt;: each non-key column describes only its own row’s key.&lt;br&gt;The website looks the same: totals, tier, discounts, stock and the bell are calculated when a page needs them." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="800" x="920" y="625" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n293" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C7A76;" value="&lt;b&gt;How to read it&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#D5E8D4&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;1 - green&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; starts here: needs no other table (create these first)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#E1D5E7&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;2, 3 … - purple&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; uses other tables; the number = the order you create them&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#F5F5F5&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;grey&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; a table from another module (only its key columns)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#E3EEFA&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;blue row&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; stored on purpose: a fact of that moment&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;bold&lt;/b&gt; = PK (primary key) · &lt;i&gt;italic&lt;/i&gt; = FK (points to another table)&lt;br&gt;Line ends: &lt;b&gt;|&lt;/b&gt; one · &lt;b&gt;o&lt;/b&gt; optional (zero) · &lt;b&gt;crow’s foot&lt;/b&gt; many" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="500" x="1250" y="805" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram name="Calculated, not stored" id="qrSZ3aveRIoe78XqNuRP">
    <mxGraphModel grid="1" page="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1900" pageHeight="1200" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="n294" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:24px&quot;&gt;Calculated, not stored&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Every value that was removed for 3NF, and exactly how the system works it out. These are what the website shows; they are never saved in a column.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="1700" x="40" y="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n295" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C7A76;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Customer’s tier (Plus / Pro / Max)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:monospace&quot;&gt;the loyalty_tiers row with the highest min_spend_usd ≤ delivered spending since the last 18-day gap without an order&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;from: orders, order_status_history, loyalty_tiers&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="92" width="840" x="40" y="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n296" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C7A76;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Customer’s total spent&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:monospace&quot;&gt;SUM(order total) of the customer’s delivered orders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;from: orders, order_items, order_status_history&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="92" width="840" x="900" y="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n297" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C7A76;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Stock on hand&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:monospace&quot;&gt;SUM(quantity_change) FROM stock_movements WHERE product_id = ?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;from: stock_movements&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="92" width="840" x="40" y="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n298" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C7A76;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Average buy cost&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:monospace&quot;&gt;SUM(quantity × unit_cost_usd) ÷ SUM(quantity) over received purchase_order_items&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;from: purchase_order_items&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="92" width="840" x="900" y="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n299" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C7A76;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Order subtotal&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:monospace&quot;&gt;SUM(quantity × unit_price_usd) FROM order_items WHERE order_id = ?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;from: order_items&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="92" width="840" x="40" y="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n300" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C7A76;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Promo discount&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:monospace&quot;&gt;the code’s percent (or $) of (subtotal − member_discount_usd)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;from: promo_codes + order_items&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="92" width="840" x="900" y="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n301" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C7A76;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Order total&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:monospace&quot;&gt;subtotal − member_discount_usd − promo discount + delivery_fee_usd&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;from: orders + subtotal&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="92" width="840" x="40" y="440" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n302" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C7A76;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Selling price (sale)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:monospace&quot;&gt;price_usd × (100 − discount_percent) ÷ 100 while discount_ends_at has not passed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;from: products&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="92" width="840" x="900" y="440" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n303" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C7A76;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Current order status&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:monospace&quot;&gt;the newest order_status_history row of the order&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;from: order_status_history&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="92" width="840" x="40" y="550" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n304" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C7A76;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Who handles the order&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:monospace&quot;&gt;changed_by of the history row that moved it to “processing”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;from: order_status_history&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="92" width="840" x="900" y="550" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n305" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C7A76;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Payment method / status&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:monospace&quot;&gt;the newest payments row of the order&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;from: payments&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="92" width="840" x="40" y="660" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n306" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C7A76;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Purchase order total&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:monospace&quot;&gt;SUM(quantity × unit_cost_usd) FROM purchase_order_items&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;from: purchase_order_items&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="92" width="840" x="900" y="660" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n307" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C7A76;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Product rating&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:monospace&quot;&gt;AVG(rating), COUNT(*) FROM product_reviews WHERE product_id = ?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;from: product_reviews&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="92" width="840" x="40" y="770" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n308" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C7A76;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Notification bell&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:monospace&quot;&gt;new orders, status changes, sent-back slips and messages of the last 30 days&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;from: orders, order_status_history, payments, order_messages&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="92" width="840" x="900" y="770" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n309" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C7A76;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Price in riel&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:monospace&quot;&gt;USD × 4,000 (shown only; money is stored in USD)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;from: any USD amount&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="92" width="840" x="40" y="880" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n310" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C7A76;" value="&lt;b&gt;Speed&lt;/b&gt;: at PsaOnline’s size these sums take milliseconds. If one ever gets slow, create a database &lt;b&gt;VIEW&lt;/b&gt; (for example &lt;i&gt;order_totals&lt;/i&gt;) — a saved query, not a table — so the numbers still can’t go out of date." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="1700" x="40" y="1000" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
