        <mxCell id="n678" edge="1" parent="1" source="n668" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;html=1;endArrow=ERzeroToMany;startArrow=ERmandOne;endFill=0;startFill=0;endSize=10;startSize=10;rounded=0;labelBackgroundColor=default;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="n673" value="1 : N">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" x="0.7" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint y="-9" as="offset" />
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="434" y="324" />
              <mxPoint x="434" y="206" />
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n679" edge="1" parent="1" source="n664" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;html=1;endArrow=ERzeroToMany;startArrow=ERmandOne;endFill=0;startFill=0;endSize=10;startSize=10;rounded=0;labelBackgroundColor=default;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="n674" value="1 : N sends">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" x="0.7" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint y="-9" as="offset" />
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="454" y="182" />
              <mxPoint x="454" y="230" />
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n680" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C7A76;" value="&lt;b&gt;Relationships&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• orders 1 : N order_messages · users 1 : N order_messages (sender_id, deleted_by)&lt;br&gt;Whether a message is from staff = is the sender the order’s customer? So no from_staff column (3NF).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;The bell&lt;/b&gt;: new orders, status changes, slips sent back and messages of the last 30 days, worked out when the page asks. The browser remembers when the bell was last opened, so nothing is stored for it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Deleting&lt;/b&gt;: customers delete their own messages; staff delete any message or the whole chat. The row stays with &lt;b&gt;deleted_at&lt;/b&gt; (when) and &lt;b&gt;deleted_by&lt;/b&gt; (who; empty = deleted automatically), and the chat shows “Message deleted by …”.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Clean-up&lt;/b&gt; (shop rules in site_settings): a chat with no new message for &lt;b&gt;chat.auto_delete_days&lt;/b&gt; (7 days) is deleted automatically; a deleted message is removed for good after &lt;b&gt;chat.purge_days&lt;/b&gt; (15 days)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="260" width="700" x="1040" y="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n681" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C7A76;" value="&lt;b&gt;How to read it&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#D5E8D4&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;1 - green&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; starts here: needs no other table (create these first)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#E1D5E7&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;2, 3 … - purple&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; uses other tables; the number = the order you create them&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#F5F5F5&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;grey&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; a table from another module (only its key columns)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#E3EEFA&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;blue row&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; stored on purpose: a fact of that moment&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;bold&lt;/b&gt; = PK (primary key) · &lt;i&gt;italic&lt;/i&gt; = FK (points to another table)&lt;br&gt;Line ends: &lt;b&gt;|&lt;/b&gt; one · &lt;b&gt;o&lt;/b&gt; optional (zero) · &lt;b&gt;crow’s foot&lt;/b&gt; many" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="500" x="40" y="424" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
              <mxCell id="dm-e1" edge="1" parent="1" source="n664" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;html=1;endArrow=ERzeroToMany;startArrow=ERzeroToOne;endFill=0;startFill=0;endSize=10;startSize=10;rounded=0;labelBackgroundColor=default;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="dm-2" value="1 : N deletes">
